[[:db/retract 17592186183667 :answer-field/choices 17592186183668] [:db/retract 17592186183667 :answer-field/choices 17592186183669] [:db/retract 17592186183667 :answer-field/choices 17592186183670] [:db/retract 17592186183667 :answer-field/choices 17592186183671] [:db/retract 17592186183667 :answer-field/choices 17592186183672] {:db/id 17592186184843 :question/problem "If $A=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 1 \\\\ -1 & -1\\end{aligned}]$, then ${A}^{4}=$" :question/worked-solution "Computing ${A}^{2},$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{A}^{2} & =A\\cdot A \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}1 & 1 \\\\ -1 & -1\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}1 & 1 \\\\ -1 & -1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =O.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNotice that, since ${A}^{2}=O,$ the matrix $A$ is a nilpotent matrix of index $2.$ \n\nWe can use this fact to compute ${A}^{4}$ quickly, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{A}^{2} & ={A}^{2}\\cdot {A}^{2} \\\\  & =O\\cdot O \\\\  & =O\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n\n$$\n{A}^{4}=[\\begin{aligned}0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0\\end{aligned}].\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186183667 :answer-field/correct "answer-a8d3b2e6-53ce-5675-9719-1e6f7e01b5ca" :answer-field/choices ["answer-a8d3b2e6-53ce-5675-9719-1e6f7e01b5ca" "answer-c9eefa24-dc26-5b64-9a24-78a5e468b6d4" "answer-bec50d68-081a-5899-b3a9-04ecbfa8e6fc" "answer-dd800906-eb9a-5ad2-843c-4ad00d0bcb7c" "answer-b4c0b97a-bdab-58f5-a07c-79787eb3f94e"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-a8d3b2e6-53ce-5675-9719-1e6f7e01b5ca" :answer/id #uuid "a8d3b2e6-53ce-5675-9719-1e6f7e01b5ca" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-c9eefa24-dc26-5b64-9a24-78a5e468b6d4" :answer/id #uuid "c9eefa24-dc26-5b64-9a24-78a5e468b6d4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]"